{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike word game that combines Balatro with Scrabble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm really into Scrabble and other word games, and Balatro was a genius example of how you could actually make a replayable, solo\u00a0version of something like that. I couldn't get the idea of mashing them up out of my head, so... now the idea is a reality! I hope you find it entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It looks fairly barebones, but it's got a decent amount of content:<br>- 100+ passives<br>- 12 bosses<br>- 3 difficulty modes<br>- 5 play styles (called &quot;bags&quot;)<br>- 10+ ways to upgrade your letters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I might improve and add to\u00a0it in the future. But I might not, too. It's just a free game developed on and off in my spare time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785350?t=1767463778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785350?t=1767463778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785350/f15c2f767b0154a302159da5e34cebd3b58a25b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767463778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785350/f15c2f767b0154a302159da5e34cebd3b58a25b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767463778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike word game that combines Balatro with Scrabble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm really into Scrabble and other word games, and Balatro was a genius example of how you could actually make a replayable, solo\u00a0version of something like that. I couldn't get the idea of mashing them up out of my head, so... now the idea is a reality! I hope you find it entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It looks fairly barebones, but it's got a decent amount of content:<br>- 100+ passives<br>- 12 bosses<br>- 3 difficulty modes<br>- 5 play styles (called &quot;bags&quot;)<br>- 10+ ways to upgrade your letters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I might improve and add to\u00a0it in the future. But I might not, too. It's just a free game developed on and off in my spare time.</p>","developers":["Ian Campbell"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785350/25d68168792baf809786b28f08a861abccfcd9dc/header.jpg?t=1767463778","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785350/1225679641/f27589680e80b7c63e64ffe2d5aa09e02370bb47/1759281196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760364537","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785350/1225679641/f27589680e80b7c63e64ffe2d5aa09e02370bb47/1759281196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760364537","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785350/1225679641/f27589680e80b7c63e64ffe2d5aa09e02370bb47/1759281196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760364537","id":257209750,"name":"Spellatro Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209750/2763baf8c93ea13fc9867d2b14d0a1040eeaa7f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760364537"}],"name":"Spellatro","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/Vista/XP<br></li><li><stron